# Financial model I recommend freezing now

For **every month**, regardless of chit type:

```text
Opening Savings
+ Verified Collections
+ Other Approved Credits
- Winner/Agent Payout
- Other Approved Debits
= Closing Savings
```

### Auction

```text
Collections = ₹25,000
Winning discount = ₹7,000

Winner payout = ₹18,000
Closing savings increases by ₹7,000
```

### Fixed Draw

```text
Collections = ₹25,000
Fixed payout = ₹20,000

Closing savings increases by ₹5,000
```

### Agent Chit

```text
Collections = ₹25,000
Agent payout = configured monthly amount

No draw
No auction
Remaining amount → savings
```

And:

```text
Month N closing savings
      =
Month N+1 opening savings
```

This should be the immutable financial invariant for the application.

