But the remaining work is mostly **hardening and consistency**, not inventing the core business model.

I would freeze the requirements now and make the next release a **Production Hardening / Final Release** focused on:

**financial reconciliation + common month-close + agent authorization + idempotency + audit + API/mobile contract consistency + role enforcement + final end-to-end test matrix.**

That is the point at which I would treat the implementation as ready to move from API/mobile testing into staging/UAT.








